committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1792131795 +0900

Block X: Mem0 event log, mem0_det and mem0_rep arms, driver with E5 prefix reuse and dry run, analysis

Adapter (adapters/native_mem0x.py): LoggedMem0 logs every Mem0 add (return value plus the rows it
wrote to Mem0's history table) to events.jsonl per store without changing the E5 path; Mem0Det
deletes, through Memory.delete, the memories an earlier revision created or updated (ledger and
log) before a revision or deletion is ingested; Mem0Rep serves the mem0 store with the D1s program
view leading definition-item evidence, as zero_Dm renders it.

Driver (experiments/x_mem0.py): restores E5's prefix snapshot when store settings, mem0ai version,
Mem0 configuration, on_error, world and servers match (else rebuilds, or aborts with
--prefix-policy resume); t0 answers as the anchor; branches src, def, orphan; fork dependency
sets; --dry-run prices a full run with E5's measured per-event costs.

Analysis (analysis/x_mem0.py): detection per item-time as registered, m, r, a per class and
branch, dominant failure, item-paired Update effects with world-bootstrap intervals, X1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
